From d6c1b370e0eb4b22429e3438bd8b5a32a108571b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:18:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: Add the OnePlus 7T sensors (IMX586, S5K3M5,
 IMX481, IMX471)

SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later AND CC0-1.0

Sensor helpers, properties and tuning stubs for the OnePlus 7T and 7T Pro
cameras, from Robin Snyders' hotdog-linux-bringup (aports/temp/libcamera
0003, 0004, 0006, 0007 and their tuning files, commit 47087509), rebased onto the Omarchy Mobile series (adjacent table entries).

Source: https://github.com/Sr-0w/hotdog-linux-bringup/tree/47087509/aports/temp/libcamera
---
